---
// Hero section with brand rail + image + nav rail
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-grid">
    <aside class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark">
        <img src="/images/logo.svg" alt="飛兎竜文堂ロゴ" width="48">
      </div>
      <div class="brand-name-jp">飛兎竜文堂</div>
      <div class="brand-name-en">Hitoryobundo</div>
    </aside>

    <div>
      <div class="hero-image" role="img" aria-label="鑑定の様子"></div>
      <div class="hero-text-block">
        <div class="hero-overline">— ABOUT HITORYOBUNDO —</div>
        <h1 class="hero-headline">
          <span class="em">星と数</span>に問い、<br>
          あなたの<span class="em">行く道</span>をひらく。
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          親譲りの直感と古典の占技をあわせ、暮らしの選択をやさしく整える。<br>
          北摂より、ひとりひとりの結び目をほどくお手伝いを。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="nav-rail" aria-label="主要メニュー">
      <a href="#service">
        <span class="ic"><img src="/images/service-icon.svg" alt="" width="108" height="auto"></span>
        <span class="lbl">サービス</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#cases">
        <span class="ic"><img src="/images/case-icon.svg" alt="" width="116" height="auto"></span>
        <span class="lbl">鑑定事例</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#profile">
        <span class="ic"><img src="/images/yukine-icon.svg" alt="" width="72" height="auto"></span>
        <span class="lbl">プロフィール</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#column">
        <span class="ic"><img src="/images/column-icon.svg" alt="" width="64" height="auto"></span>
        <span class="lbl">コラム</span>
      </a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
